title: 'SwapFirstAssetTrader: refund the whole fee held'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `SwapFirstAssetTrader::refund_weight` refused a refund equal to the fee it held, so a
    `RefundSurplus` of the whole purchase refunded nothing while `UsingComponents` refunds it in
    full. The guard is now strict, so a refund of exactly the fee held is served.
crates:
- name: cumulus-primitives-utility
  bump: patch
